    "media:imagetext": "CHINA AIRLINES, LTD.\nBetween SAN FRANCISCO/\nTOKYO/TAIPEI AND HONGKONG\nBOEING 707 JETS\nEffective April 26, 1970\nFlight CI-1\n(Daily except Sunday)\nSan Francisco\nLv 1415\n(Daily except Sunday)\nFlight CI-12\nHongkong\nLv 1115\nTokyo A\nAv 1900\nLv 2000\nTaipei\nAv 1130\nFlight CI-2\nAv 2200\nTaipei\nFollowing day\nFlight CI-11\n(Daily except Sunday)\nTaipei\nLv 1230\nTokyo\nAv 1620\nLv 1720\nTaipei\nLV\n0800\nHongkong\nAv\n1015\nSan Francisco +\nAv 1035\nAll schedules are in local times.\n*Due to International Date Line arrival Tokyo is DAY\nFOLLOWING departure from San Francisco.\n‡Due to International Date Line arrival San Francisco\nSAME DAY as departure Tokyo.\nADMINISTRATION OFFICE\n391 Sutter Street\nSan Francisco\n(415) 391-3950\nSan Francisco Airport Manager 873-0730\nPassenger Reservations and Information 989-3300\nCargo Reservations and Information 989-3300\nCargo Receivable 873-0963\nFlight Information (415) 761-1488\nSALES OFFICE\nSan Francisco\n• 390 Stockton Street\nLos Angeles\n• 604 West 6th Street\n• (415) 391-3955\n• (213) 624-1161",
